    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050700/extras/e5df3c2b8cc02a9196a279a979074b6b.avif?t=1744862699\" width=616 height=202 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game objectives</h2>After a storm left an island, everything is scattered to different positions, your objectives are to pick up and deliver objects to their original positions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050700/extras/8407cb296e20280328d927703adf9c16.poster.avif?t=1744862699\" width=616 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050700/extras/8407cb296e20280328d927703adf9c16.webm?t=1744862699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050700/extras/8407cb296e20280328d927703adf9c16.mp4?t=1744862699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Hidden Object</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>To know the original position of objects, player move to touch to active the hollow stars (there are 5) which carved on the island.<br></li><li>An active hollow star will shine upon the original position of 5 objects.<br></li><li>Player will look at the entire island and pickup the objects and deliver it to the original position.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050700/extras/97a6c8456ba46260b54c7059285aa6a7.avif?t=1744862699\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Adventure</h2>Relax yourself in this little adventure to different locations. Meet new friends at new islands. Have a talk or do a quest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Action Hidden Object<br></li><li> NPC side story along your journey.<br></li><li> Multiple level which increase in difficulty.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Objectives</h2>Game objectives summary in short description, hope you will find it easier to understand:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An island have objects (tree, fruits, grass, chair...) on it.<br></li><li>A storm rampaged the island and make objects on the island to scatters to different position.<br></li><li>Player's objectives are to move objects to their original positions.<br></li><li>To know the original position of objects, player move to touch to active the hollow stars (there are 5) which carved on the island.<br></li><li>An active hollow star will shine upon the original position of 5 objects.<br></li><li>Player will look at the entire island and pickup the objects and deliver it to the original position.</li></ul>",
