r></li><li> Multiple level which increase in difficulty.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Objectives</h2>Game objectives summary in short description, hope you will find it easier to understand:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An island have objects (tree, fruits, grass, chair...) on it.<br></li><li>A storm rampaged the island and make objects on the island to scatters to different position.<br></li><li>Player's objectives are to move objects to their original positions.<br></li><li>To know the original position of objects, player move to touch to active the hollow stars (there are 5) which carved on the island.<br></li><li>An active hollow star will shine upon the original position of 5 objects.<br></li><li>Player will look at the entire island and pickup the objects and deliver it to the original position.</li></ul>",
